[[SECTION]]
PREFIX: TC-H1FWMC-
TITLE: Test Protocol

[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWMC-153
TITLE: USB - PC Command Processing - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
The user can run the boot loading process via GUI and erase the flash memory's space of the firmware application.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
1. A new version of the firmware application is provided in the USB
2. System is not running anything
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Run the boot loading process via the GUI
2. Click the Logs symbol in the left-hand side of screen
3. Check for the new version of the firmware application in the logs
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the process is working properly to load a new version of the firmware application
2. Verify logs are loaded in the middle of the screen
3. Verify the version is matching with the newly loaded firmware application
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWMC-49
  ROLE: Verifies

