[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWMC-155
TITLE: USB - CRC Flash Erase - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
The user can run the boot loading process via GUI and erase the flash memory's space of the firmware application.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
1. A new version of the firmware application is provided in the USB
2. System is not running anything
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Run the boot loading process via the GUI
2. Click the Logs symbol in the left-hand side of screen
3. Check for the erasing activity of the application in the USB
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the process is working properly to erase the area corresponding to application CRC verification in the USB
2. Verify logs are loaded in the middle of the screen
3. Verify the logs display the activity of the erasing area of the USB
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWMC-47
  ROLE: Verifies

